OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet and windy day associated
OL,6,Fwith Storm Austen. The odd dry spell
OL,7,Fin places to start the day, otherwise
OL,8,Fheavy outbreaks of rain push through
OL,9,Fwith isolated gales possible in
OL,10,Fexposed areas by afternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FRain clearing away to the
OL,13,Fnortheast during the evening, leading
OL,14,Fto a dry night with clear spells.
OL,15,FWinds slowly ease through the night.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSaturday:FAnother wet and windy day as
OL,18,FStorm Boelo pushes eastwards.
OL,19,FWidespread heavy rain and disruptive
OL,20,Fwinds with isolated gales possible in
OL,21,Fexposed areas.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
