OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FA
OL,6,Fdrier, brighter day on Sunday although
OL,7,Fremaining windy until evening.
OL,8,FUnsettled conditions return into the
OL,9,Fnew working week with rain and strong
OL,10,Fwinds arriving early Monday.
